sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant I as Inventory
  participant R as Redis
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant W as WebSocket
  C->>I: POST holds + Idempotency-Key
  I->>R: Lua verify seats + TTL 5m
  R-->>I: success/failure
  I->>D: persist ACTIVE seat_holds
  I->>W: seat.availability.changed(version)
  W-->>C: changed seats
  C->>I: POST orders
  I->>D: lock seats, RESERVED 15m, convert hold
  I->>W: seat.availability.changed(version)
